{"capturado_en": "2026-11-17T17:58:33+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Signal Control Simulator", "steam_appid": 2794180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "You can experience the work of a &quot;signal worker&quot; who protects the safety of Japan's railways behind the scenes.<br>Operate the interlocking board to run the train according to the schedule determined in seconds.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Realistic interlocking board using 3DCG<br></li><li>Operation of interlocking panels similar to the real thing, such as locks</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stations where you can experience</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hinatagaoka 2 sides 4 lines<br></li><li>Harukaze Park 2nd floor 6th line<br></li><li>Toyotama/Mukoyama 2nd floor, 6th line (Toyotama), 1th floor, 2nd line (Mukaiyama)</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "You can experience the work of a &quot;signal worker&quot; who protects the safety of Japan's railways behind the scenes.<br>Operate the interlocking board to run the train according to the schedule determined in seconds.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Realistic interlocking board using 3DCG<br></li><li>Operation of interlocking panels similar to the real thing, such as locks</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stations where you can experience</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hinatagaoka 2 sides 4 lines<br></li><li>Harukaze Park 2nd floor 6th line<br></li><li>Toyotama/Mukoyama 2nd floor, 6th line (Toyotama), 1th floor, 2nd line (Mukaiyama)</li></ul>", "short_description": "The job of a &quot;signal worker&quot; is to protect the safety of Japan's railways behind the scenes. Operate the interlocking panels to safely and accurately operate trains that run in seconds. You can experience the work of a signal attendant, which is essential for safe railway operation.", "supported_languages": "Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages w